w has no accessory view on its right side. The return value","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of this method is ignored if ","type":"text"},{"code":"-mapView:calloutViewForAnnotation:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is present in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the delegate.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To display a view on the callout’s left side, implement the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-mapView:leftCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Related examples","level":4,"anchor":"Related-examples","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"TODO: Default callout usage, learn how to modify the view that is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"displayed on the right side of the standard callout bubble.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate\/mapView:rightCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:"},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapViewDelegate/mapView:rightCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapviewdelegate\/mapview:rightcalloutaccessoryviewforannotation:","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate\/mapView:rightCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns the view to display on the right side of the standard callout bubble."}],"role":"symbol","title":"mapView:rightCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mapView:rightCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"type":"topic","title":"MapLibre","abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit w